    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s time for your starring role in Deep Cuts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of Elise Weber, co-founder of film production studio Lights Camera Faction, as they embark on a blockbuster quest to save their best friend and creative partner by venturing through the duo\u2019s expansive film catalog. Relive all of LCF\u2019s iconic and cinematic moments as you gain superpowers and face off against a maniacal group of deprecated and deadly cartoon characters \u2013 The Learning Lads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/a7cec42e3e7fa0def0f5fd861c4dd9fc.poster.avif?t=1755251899\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/a7cec42e3e7fa0def0f5fd861c4dd9fc.webm?t=1755251899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/a7cec42e3e7fa0def0f5fd861c4dd9fc.mp4?t=1755251899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics Action! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kinetically driven and dynamically interactive melee and firearms combat with diverse weapon options inside highly responsive environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/59d405119288b2d4f992130ffab41ec7.poster.avif?t=1755251899\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/59d405119288b2d4f992130ffab41ec7.webm?t=1755251899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/59d405119288b2d4f992130ffab41ec7.mp4?t=1755251899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Lore and Environmental Storytelling! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the rich backstory of LCF and their hidden secrets as you journey through beloved movie genres and tropes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/f05610e045ca55bc4a38c54534769675.poster.avif?t=1755251899\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/f05610e045ca55bc4a38c54534769675.webm?t=1755251899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/f05610e045ca55bc4a38c54534769675.mp4?t=1755251899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Neurareel Film Experiences! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in real-time scenes within living movie sets, mixing life and art in ways previously unexplored. Dive into various film genres from 1980s Horror and Retrofuturistic Sci-fi to Spaghetti Western and Film Noir as you take on the roles of different protagonists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/587425dec1811c6033243a5fcf3c1196.poster.avif?t=1755251899\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/587425dec1811c6033243a5fcf3c1196.webm?t=1755251899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/587425dec1811c6033243a5fcf3c1196.mp4?t=1755251899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time Manipulation Abilities! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness cinematic augmentations, granting editing actions on the fly that make you the director. Use these abilities strategically to overcome obstacles, solve puzzles, and enemy barrages.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s time for your starring role in Deep Cuts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of Elise Weber, co-founder of film production studio Lights Camera Faction, as they embark on a blockbuster quest to save their best friend and creative partner by venturing through the duo\u2019s expansive film catalog. Relive all of LCF\u2019s iconic and cinematic moments as you gain superpowers and face off against a maniacal group of deprecated and deadly cartoon characters \u2013 The Learning Lads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/a7cec42e3e7fa0def0f5fd861c4dd9fc.poster.avif?t=1755251899\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/a7cec42e3e7fa0def0f5fd861c4dd9fc.webm?t=1755251899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/a7cec42e3e7fa0def0f5fd861c4dd9fc.mp4?t=1755251899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics Action! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kinetically driven and dynamically interactive melee and firearms combat with diverse weapon options inside highly responsive environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/59d405119288b2d4f992130ffab41ec7.poster.avif?t=1755251899\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/59d405119288b2d4f992130ffab41ec7.webm?t=1755251899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/59d405119288b2d4f992130ffab41ec7.mp4?t=1755251899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Lore and Environmental Storytelling! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the rich backstory of LCF and their hidden secrets as you journey through beloved movie genres and tropes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/f05610e045ca55bc4a38c54534769675.poster.avif?t=1755251899\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/f05610e045ca55bc4a38c54534769675.webm?t=1755251899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/f05610e045ca55bc4a38c54534769675.mp4?t=1755251899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Neurareel Film Experiences! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in real-time scenes within living movie sets, mixing life and art in ways previously unexplored. Dive into various film genres from 1980s Horror and Retrofuturistic Sci-fi to Spaghetti Western and Film Noir as you take on the roles of different protagonists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/587425dec1811c6033243a5fcf3c1196.poster.avif?t=1755251899\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/587425dec1811c6033243a5fcf3c1196.webm?t=1755251899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035010/extras/587425dec1811c6033243a5fcf3c1196.mp4?t=1755251899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time Manipulation Abilities! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness cinematic augmentations, granting editing actions on the fly that make you the director. Use these abilities strategically to overcome obstacles, solve puzzles, and enemy barrages.</p>",
    "short_description": "Genre-bending blend of messy physics, storytelling, and highly detailed worlds. A new chapter in the Scythe Saga Universe from the horror masterminds behind Happy's Humble Burger Farm!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cIt takes you behind the scenes to create your own action-packed scenes as eccentrically as you wish them to be. And, spoiler alert, it's as wacky as it is fun.\u201d<br>UploadVR<br><br>\u201cDeep Cuts is one of the most entertaining and well-written games I\u2019ve played in VR, offering a great campaign and plenty of sights and sounds to see and experience. There\u2019s really nothing quite like this one.\u201d<br>VICE<br><br>\u201cWhen everything aligns perfectly, it creates an exhilarating experience that few other genres can match, delivering a thrilling sense of joy.\u201d<br>The VR Realm<br>",
